<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://indie-game-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:12:41 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>Godot 2026 年度作品集锦</title><link>https://godotengine.org/article/godot-showreel-2026</link><description>Godot 官方放出 2026 年作品集锦，今年收到 422 份投稿创下新纪录，片中收录了《Slay the Spire 2》等社区作品的实机画面。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">48a8ab73bfd70b1355b6630a5a14ff5837d7d05c</guid><source url="https://godotengine.org/article/godot-showreel-2026">Godot 引擎博客</source></item><item><title>《GTA 6》212GB 首发的工程内幕：实时资源流式加载与主机性能如何被重新定义</title><link>https://dev.to/trendzbetagames/engineering-the-212-gb-launch-how-gta-6-redefines-real-time-asset-streaming-and-console-performance-2fdo</link><description>从 212GB 安装体量切入，拆解《GTA 6》如何用直通存储解压与流式加载预算消灭开放世界读条，以及光追全局光照在画质与帧率之间的取舍。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:50:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1f8e5217b6ea3f06b98844f316ceedfa397020eb</guid><source url="https://dev.to/trendzbetagames/engineering-the-212-gb-launch-how-gta-6-redefines-real-time-asset-streaming-and-console-performance-2fdo">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>深入 GTA 6：引擎架构、PSSR 超分与 PS5 Pro 性能解析</title><link>https://dev.to/trendzbetagames/inside-gta-6-engine-architecture-pssr-upscaling-and-ps5-pro-performance-5e4a</link><description>从 PS5 Pro 上实录的 4K 通关流程出发，拆解 GTA 6 的 PSSR 机器学习超分、实时光追全局光照与异步世界模拟等引擎技术要点。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 02:20:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">c39922cd61011381f93ae81e9a63d78b1418caa0</guid><source url="https://dev.to/trendzbetagames/inside-gta-6-engine-architecture-pssr-upscaling-and-ps5-pro-performance-5e4a">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>GameMaker Awards 2026 投票开启</title><link>https://gamemaker.io/blog/gamemaker-awards-2026-voting</link><description