:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3bb92db16b4c43655711f6290207b94869ed9f46</guid><source url="https://www.yystv.cn/p/14649">游研社</source></item><item><title>用 6 行 JS 屏幕震动加顿帧技巧，立刻给游戏加上“打击感”</title><link>https://dev.to/goutam_lambu_0a07d682a4ee/add-instant-game-feel-with-this-6-line-js-screen-shake-hit-stop-trick-1ifm</link><description>不用物理引擎，六行代码就能在渲染循环里实现屏幕震动与顿帧，让 2D 网页小游戏瞬间有了街机般的手感。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:00:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5d5b80ea84e34c545b57d2eb3458101b7af294fb</guid><source url="https://dev.to/goutam_lambu_0a07d682a4ee/add-instant-game-feel-with-this-6-line-js-screen-shake-hit-stop-trick-1ifm">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>一套 TypeScript 代码，两个引擎：用 Claude Opus 为 Epic AI MegaJam 打造《Hook Horizon》</title><link>https://dev.to/spacedevin/one-typescript-codebase-two-engines-building-hook-horizon-with-claude-opus-for-the-epic-ai-megajam-3glf</link><description>开发者用四天时间以同一套 TypeScript 代码，让钓鱼线平台跳跃游戏同时跑在浏览器与 Unreal Engine 5.8 上，全程借助 Claude Opus 完成。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:31:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">8358d12e8db4257b1fc175ab86f6eadb7428c8d4</guid><source url="https://dev.to/spacedevin/one-typescript-codebase-two-engines-building-hook-horizon-with-claude-opus-for-the-epic-ai-megajam-3glf">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>冒险大陆 Ω-Genesis 隐藏职业全解：6 大四转怎么解锁</title><link>https://dev.to/mark_001/mou-xian-da-lu-o-genesis-yin-cang-zhi-ye-quan-jie-6-da-si-zhuan-zen-yao-jie-suo-252j</link><description>这篇攻略整理了《冒险大陆 Ω-Genesis》六个隐藏四转职业的解锁条件与转职路线，职业树与进阶设计可供做养成系统的开发者参考。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:54:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">21c7873c39bb258800243ec7091b898ead3f6af9</guid><source url="https://dev.to/mark_001/mou-xian-da-lu-o-genesis-yin-cang-zhi-ye-quan-jie-6-da-si-zhuan-zen-yao-jie-suo-252j">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>腾讯Q3游戏收入665亿元，高管：游戏业创新放缓、AI加快创新，要推动组织变革</title><link>http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/606770</link><description>腾讯三季度游戏收入达